Author: Collie Kart project (based on CTRPluginFramework Blank Template)

Version:
    Major: 0
    Minor: 0
    Revision: 14

Targets:

Title: Collie Kart Portable P007a.1

Summary: Read-only recorder with 5-second resume grace and failure-stage diagnostics

Description: |
    P007a.1 patches a failed recorder startup with manual
    demonstration recording. A separate in-RAM recorder targets 20Hz,
    reading position, speed, game-frame buttons and stick. A compact
    reference trajectory is extracted on-device; CSV saved by explicit
    menu action after stopping. No autonomous play, model training,
    synthetic controls or native-hook installation are available
    through the P007a.1 menu. P006.4 is the proven hardware fallback.
    Travel heading is estimated from position deltas, NOT actual yaw.

Compatibility: Any

MemorySize: 5MiB

UsePrivateMemory: false
